# Preview failures

## The preview window does not open

Run the same app with `--no-window` and open the printed URL in a browser. If
the browser works, the HTTP server is fine: check platform Wry dependencies.
On Linux, WebKitGTK 4.1 development libraries are the usual gap.

## Dev Console shows nothing from a component

Components are pure. Log with `Stderr.line!` from handlers under `rocci run`.
There is no `@log`.

## Live reload did not refresh

`--no-live-reload` pauses automatic refresh on purpose; watch still rebuilds.
Hard-reload the browser tab after a failed compile.

`rocci browse` is the component gallery only. It does not open a project
picker or launch other products.

